                padding, 5.0
            ),
            Separator(),
            # Properties are auto-generated from the ClonerData class
            # This is a placeholder for the details view
            Text(text, "Properties will be displayed here")
        )
    
    fn set_object():
        # Updates the properties panel with the selected ClonerData asset
        # In UE5, this would receive FClonerData* via the asset editor context
        # selected_object = obj
        println("Properties panel updated")

